    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Bzzt...* </i>This is Lisa, with Michael and the others. We're trapped inside Inn 8. It's 2 AM... our phones, our cameras\u2014they're almost dead. *<i>Bzzt...*</i> Don't come into Inn 8! If you see this, run! Call the police to save us, if we're still alive... Something's wrong here... I saw... Oh no, Michael! *<i>Click*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/2a969baf3ae02e6e50a48a96039713bd.avif?t=1736218050\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today is a perfect day for a walk in the forest, and maybe take a few beautiful photos. But be careful and don't enter strange buildings! There's a rumor about an inn 8 in the forest with maddening magic. Once you enter, there's no way out\u2014former guests either died or went mad. No one knows what they saw or experienced inside. Will you be the one to break the curse and survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/b4bbbfcd5bacb1b218fbddb423caa494.avif?t=1736218050\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into the woods and explore the forsaken inn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a deal with the devil, suffer eternal damnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless rooms\u2014where is the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize unique game mechanics to solve puzzles skillfully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.poster.avif?t=1736218050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.webm?t=1736218050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.mp4?t=1736218050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is created by <strong>@AMIN</strong> with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/d56826d41e516e65836613f6c39b889f.avif?t=1736218050\" width=720 height=216 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Bzzt...* </i>This is Lisa, with Michael and the others. We're trapped inside Inn 8. It's 2 AM... our phones, our cameras\u2014they're almost dead. *<i>Bzzt...*</i> Don't come into Inn 8! If you see this, run! Call the police to save us, if we're still alive... Something's wrong here... I saw... Oh no, Michael! *<i>Click*</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/2a969baf3ae02e6e50a48a96039713bd.avif?t=1736218050\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today is a perfect day for a walk in the forest, and maybe take a few beautiful photos. But be careful and don't enter strange buildings! There's a rumor about an inn 8 in the forest with maddening magic. Once you enter, there's no way out\u2014former guests either died or went mad. No one knows what they saw or experienced inside. Will you be the one to break the curse and survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/b4bbbfcd5bacb1b218fbddb423caa494.avif?t=1736218050\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deep into the woods and explore the forsaken inn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a deal with the devil, suffer eternal damnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless rooms\u2014where is the end?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize unique game mechanics to solve puzzles skillfully.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.poster.avif?t=1736218050\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.webm?t=1736218050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/fc159b1563f26c27c6d32862e34e6621.mp4?t=1736218050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is created by <strong>@AMIN</strong> with YAHAHA Horror Game Kit and YAHAHA assists the creator with packaging and publishing the game based on their request. Yahaha Horror Gamekit is tailored for imaginative creators and players who adore horror games, all without the need for any programming expertise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298640/extras/d56826d41e516e65836613f6c39b889f.avif?t=1736218050\" width=720 height=216 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Inn 8 is a first-person horror adventure game with unique gameplay mechanics. Stumbled upon a cursed inn while taking a selfie in the wild. Endless rooms and terrifying monsters await. Use your wits to uncover the house's evil secrets, defeat your enemies and break the curse.",
